			dependencies: ["0C769BB94D282CC6"]
			description: [
				"Base Difficulty is a set of &2comprehensive difficulty options&r, including health multipliers, damage multipliers, armor multipliers, and several other settings. It is &2independent&r from the difficulty settings described later."
				""
				"At higher base difficulty levels, certain monsters will drop additional loot."
				""
				"For regular players, &6Difficulty 1&r is recommended. For players seeking specific damage-related challenges, &6Difficulty 4&r is suggested, as it allows access to certain rare and special drop items."
				""
				"Players are not encouraged to blindly compare damage output. This modpack simply provides a unique gameplay experience and is not intended to compare the overall strength between different mods or modpacks."
				""
				"From a design perspective, this modpack is intended to allow even a player with no prior calculation or knowledge of its content to &2comfortably&r complete all gameplay content."
				""
				"The specific base difficulty settings are shown in the following table."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"1 : Normal health, normal damage, normal armor"
				"2 : 2× health, normal damage, normal armor"
				"3 : 3× health, normal damage, normal armor"
				"4 : 5× health, 1.5× damage, normal armor &6(rare drops)&r"
				"5 : 10× health, 1.5× damage, normal armor"
				"6 : 20× health, 2× damage, 1.5× armor"
				"7 : 30× health, 3× damage, normal armor"
				"8 : 50× health, 4× damage, 2× armor"
				"9 : 100× health, 5× damage, 2× armor &4(not recommended)&r"
				"10 : 300× health, 6× damage, 2.5× armor"
				"11 : 500× health, 7× damage, 2.5× armor"
				"12 : 1000× health, 8× damage, 3× armor"
			]
